internal Producer. This slice has compile evidence but lacks a dedicated
production-path regression. Broad P18-V01 source/API/settings/input/error/
control-flow and reverse-export reconciliation remains `PARTIAL`. P18-V04
current-revision platform evidence remains open. No remote CI was run, and the
Phase 19 Docker paths were left untouched.
